# w8fix-place W8-03-02 [RE: FUN_0047D1C0 overlay branch; rulesmd SROCK*/TROCK*
# Land=Rock NoUseTileLandType=true]: SOV10T, the SROCK05 cell (125,64) is
# impassable Rock -- a Rhino ordered across it never stands on it.
set render_every 0
set on_quit continue
set campaign SOV10T.MAP Nod
click start
until 300 scene == game
require scene == game
waituntil 1500 input_locked == 0
wait 5
cheat camp_spawn HTNK 0 124 64
wait 3
cheat camp_move HTNK 126 64
repeat 30
wait 10
assert ucell(0,HTNK,0) != 125064
endrepeat
cheat camp_move HTNK 125 64
repeat 20
wait 10
assert ucell(0,HTNK,0) != 125064
endrepeat
end
